{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# SU(3) adjoint chain, L = 2 — untwisting the normalized scalar product\n\nStarting point (`SU3_L2_Baxter_Twisted_Final.wb`): for a unimodular twist, for all 64 states and every admissible row triple,\n$$\n\\frac{\\langle L_A|R_B\\rangle}{\\langle L_A|0\\rangle\\langle0|R_B\\rangle}=C_{\\rm vac}\\,\\frac{\\det N^{AB}}{c_A^{\\rm ref}\\Psi_B^{\\rm ref}} .\n$$\n\nHere $z_j=e^{\\varepsilon\\varphi_j}$ with $\\sum_j\\varphi_j=0$, and we expand as $\\varepsilon\\to0$. Plan:\n\n1. Measure how $\\langle0|R\\rangle$ and $\\langle L|0\\rangle$ vanish, state by state.\n2. Use the row triple $\\{(1,3),(1,2),(2,3)\\}$, whose Q-functions regularize exactly ($Q_1$, $Q^3$ regular; $Q_2$, $Q^2$ by an allowed triangular move).\n3. Compute $C_{\\rm vac}(\\varepsilon,\\varphi)$ in closed form.\n4. Expand $\\det N$ and assemble $\\langle\\psi_0|\\psi_0\\rangle$ = untwisted Q-determinant × explicit factors.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. gl(3) adjoint generators and the L=2 chain; twist enters only through TcoU. ---- *)\nClearAll[ps, dim, J0, Jp, Jm, JJ, v, repU, dsU, dcU, idU, EEU, E1U, E2U, EtotU, thetaU, TmonU, qminorU, qcoU, TcoU, nu1U, nu2U, nu3U, qdetU, u];\n\nps[rr_] :=\n    ps[rr] =\n    Block[\n        {res = Prepend[rr, #]& /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rr〚1, i + 1〛, rr〚1, i〛], {i, 1, Length[rr〚1〛] - 1}]]},\n        If[Length[res〚1, 1〛] == 1, Reverse @ Sort @ res, Reverse @ Sort @ Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]\n    ];\ndim[rr_] := dim[rr] = Length[ps[{rr}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat〚k, i〛, {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat〚k - 1, i〛, {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] :=\n    Jp[k][pat] =\n    -Sum[\n        Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k + 1, j〛 + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]\n        / Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k, j〛 + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} → pat〚k, i〛 + 1]],\n        {i, 1, k}\n    ];\nJm[k_][pat_] :=\n    Jm[k][pat] =\n    Sum[\n        Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k - 1, j〛 + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]\n        / Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k, j〛 + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} → pat〚k, i〛 - 1]],\n        {i, 1, k}\n    ];\nJJ[k_, l_, rr_] :=\n    JJ[k, l, rr] =\n    Which[\n        k == l,\n        DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rr}]],\n        l == k + 1,\n        Transpose @ Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rr}]〚i〛], v[#]]& /@ ps[{rr}], {i, Length[ps[{rr}]]}],\n        l == k - 1,\n        Transpose @ Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rr}]〚i〛], v[#]]& /@ ps[{rr}], {i, Length[ps[{rr}]]}],\n        l > k + 1,\n        JJ[k, k + 1, rr].JJ[k + 1, l, rr] - JJ[k + 1, l, rr].JJ[k, k + 1, rr],\n        l < k - 1,\n        JJ[k, k - 1, rr].JJ[k - 1, l, rr] - JJ[k - 1, l, rr].JJ[k, k - 1, rr]\n    ];\n\nrepU = {2, 1, 0};\ndsU = dim[repU];\ndcU = dsU^2;\nidU = IdentityMatrix[dsU];\nEEU[i_, j_] := EEU[i, j] = JJ[i, j, repU];\nE1U[i_, j_] := E1U[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[EEU[i, j], idU];\nE2U[i_, j_] := E2U[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[idU, EEU[i, j]];\nEtotU[i_, j_] := E1U[i, j] + E2U[i, j];\n\n(* Same chain point as the Final notebook; h = 1 is hard-coded in shifts below. *)\nthetaU = {1 / 3, -8 / 57};\n\nTmonU[i_, j_][x_] :=\n    Sum[\n        ((x - thetaU〚1〛) KroneckerDelta[i, k] IdentityMatrix[dcU] - E1U[k, i]).((x - thetaU〚2〛) KroneckerDelta[k, j] IdentityMatrix[dcU] - E2U[j, k]),\n        {k, 3}\n    ];\nqminorU[II_] := Expand @ Sum[Signature[s] Dot @@ Table[TmonU[II〚s〚k〛〛, II〚k〛][u - (k - 1)], {k, Length[II]}], {s, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\nDo[With[{m = qminorU[II]}, Do[qcoU[II, k] = Coefficient[m, u, k], {k, 0, 2 Length[II]}]], {II, Join @@ (Subsets[Range[3], {#}]& /@ Range[3])}];\n(* Exact for exact z; numeric for numeric z. *)\nTcoU[a_, k_, z_List] := Sum[(Times @@ z〚II〛) qcoU[II, k], {II, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\n\nnu1U[x_] := Product[x - th - 2, {th, thetaU}];\nnu2U[x_] := Product[x - th - 1, {th, thetaU}];\nnu3U[x_] := Product[x - th, {th, thetaU}];\nqdetU[x_] := nu1U[x - 2] nu2U[x - 1] nu3U[x];\n\nWith[\n    {zt = {5 / 2, 7 / 3, 6 / 35}, zero = ConstantArray[0, {dcU, dcU}]},\n    Grid[\n        {\n            {\n                \"T1, T2 coefficients commute (z = {5/2,7/3,6/35})\",\n                And\n                @@ Flatten @ Table[TcoU[a, k, zt].TcoU[b, l, zt] - TcoU[b, l, zt].TcoU[a, k, zt] === zero, {a, 2}, {b, 2}, {k, 0, 2 a}, {l, 0, 2 b}]\n            },\n            {\"T3 = qdet for a unimodular twist\", Expand[Sum[TcoU[3, k, zt] u^k, {k, 0, 6}] - qdetU[u] IdentityMatrix[dcU]] === zero},\n            {\n                \"zero twist: T_a commute with total gl(3)\",\n                And\n                @@ Flatten\n                @ Table[TcoU[a, k, {1, 1, 1}].EtotU[i, j] - EtotU[i, j].TcoU[a, k, {1, 1, 1}] === zero, {a, 2}, {k, 0, 2 a}, {i, 3}, {j, 3}]\n            }\n        },\n        Frame → All,\n        Alignment → Left\n    ]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"752601\" data-output-id=\"25\" data-out-n=\"182\" data-sub-idx=\"27\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"67\" data-sub-end=\"87\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[182]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"26\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T1, T2 coefficients commute (z = {5/2,7/3,6/35})</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T3 = qdet for a unimodular twist</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">zero twist: T_a commute with total gl(3)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[182]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{T1, T2 coefficients commute (z = \\{5/2,7/3,6/35\\})} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{T3 = qdet for a unimodular twist} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{zero twist: T\\_a commute with total gl(3)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
